Clinical guideline corpus
-------------------------

Third-party content (NICE, CKS, CDC, WHO) is fetched for local research
use only. It is **never committed and never redistributed** — the
corpus directory is gitignored. `corpus/manifest.yaml` is the committed
provenance record of what was fetched and from where.


